  "status": "error",
  "reason": "deploy_failed",
  "message": "Resource is limited - try again in 24 hours (more than 100, code: \"api-deployments-free-per-day\").",
  "next": [
    {
      "command": "vercel deploy",
      "when": "retry deploy"
    }
  ]
} の一手だけ。folksound-atlas 本体は稼働中。
